    </div><div class="section-20">
      <div class="container-1280">
        <h2 data-w-id="d8141653-e84e-02d5-486a-fe1236f7bbbc" style="opacity:0" class="h2-prix left">The questions we are asked about our <span class="gradient-text">NF525 certification:</span></h2>
        <div class="w-layout-grid faq-solutions prix">
          <div id="w-node-d8141653-e84e-02d5-486a-fe1236f7bbc2-6643cbb4" data-w-id="d8141653-e84e-02d5-486a-fe1236f7bbc2" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>What is NF525 certification?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">NF525 certification is a standard that guarantees the compliance of cash register software with security, inalterability, data retention and archiving requirements to combat VAT fraud. It's been a legal requirement since 2018 on pain of a €7,500 fine per non-certified software.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-d8141653-e84e-02d5-486a-fe1236f7bbcd-6643cbb4" data-w-id="d8141653-e84e-02d5-486a-fe1236f7bbcd" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Which professionals are covered by the NF525 standard?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">The standard is mandatory for all VAT-registered professionals invoicing customers not subject to VAT. Foodservice professionals are subject to this standard.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-d8141653-e84e-02d5-486a-fe1236f7bbd8-6643cbb4" data-w-id="d8141653-e84e-02d5-486a-fe1236f7bbd8" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Is a professional cash register mandatory for my restaurant?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">The law does not require merchants to equip themselves with a cash register software or system, or a cash register. However, since January 1, 2018, in order to combat VAT fraud, all VAT-registered professionals recording customer payments using cash register software are required to use a secure, NF525-certified system.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-d8141653-e84e-02d5-486a-fe1236f7bbe3-6643cbb4" data-w-id="d8141653-e84e-02d5-486a-fe1236f7bbe3" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>What are the risks of using non-certified cash register software?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">In the case of non-certified software, you risk a fine of €7,500 per non-compliant cash register system or software, as well as a request for compliance within 60 days. In the case of false certification, you risk a fine of €45,000 and up to 3 years' imprisonment.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-d8141653-e84e-02d5-486a-fe1236f7bbee-6643cbb4" data-w-id="d8141653-e84e-02d5-486a-fe1236f7bbee" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How do I know if my cash register software is certified?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Start by checking that the certification comes from an accredited body. <br>There are only 2 organizations authorized to issue a valid certificate of conformity: <br>- AFNOR (Association Française de Normalisation), which issues NF525 accreditation<br>- LNE (Laboratoire National de Métrologie et d'Essais), which issues LNE certification.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_63a6d3a9-dfff-9445-d187-f2224ae2689c-6643cbb4" data-w-id="63a6d3a9-dfff-9445-d187-f2224ae2689c" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>My cash register or cash register software is not certified and I'd like to change it.</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Contact an Innovorder advisor who will explain how you can get back into compliance as quickly as possible.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-e8ea97e2-fab1-1df2-5b2d-a92e091b4bfe-6643cbb4" data-w-id="e8ea97e2-fab1-1df2-5b2d-a92e091b4bfe" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Are NF525-certified cash registers and software more expensive?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Certification has no influence on the price of cash register solutions. It simply certifies that the accounting solution complies with French tax regulations. It's a guarantee of compliance and security for your customers' transactions, but also of the reliability of your cash register provider.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_599ccbe0-d2b0-16b8-6fe6-06f27dfd56e8-6643cbb4" data-w-id="599ccbe0-d2b0-16b8-6fe6-06f27dfd56e8" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How can I obtain NF525 certification for my establishment if I have a checkout at Innovorder?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">You can <a href="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/6644c68bf09dcb43228f39f0_e0c4576b829fe27897fb590f35e3eb40_Certificat%20NF%20525%20Innovorder%202025.pdf" target="_blank" class="link-faq">download your certificate by clicking here.</a><br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_00c42f1b-e9f5-744b-3fde-bf21f35a0fff-6643cbb4" data-w-id="00c42f1b-e9f5-744b-3fde-bf21f35a0fff" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Where can I get more information about NF525 and NF?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Find all the information you need on the <a href="https://infocert.org/nf525/" target="_blank" class="link-faq">INFOCERT website</a> or on the <a href="https://marque-nf.com/" target="_blank" class="link-faq">Marque NF</a> website <a href="https://marque-nf.com/" target="_blank" class="link-faq">.</a><br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
